{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, scaling to zero for spiky traffic."}
{"t":"req","text":"Serverless, pay-per-use only"}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","httpdns","cloud-native-api-gateway","waf","fc","tair","tablestore","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"clients","kind":"external","label":"Clients","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile App","group":"clients","why":"End users calling the REST API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"httpdns","label":"HTTPDNS","group":null,"why":"Prevents DNS hijacking for mobile clients."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes REST calls, handles auth and throttling."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"gw","why":"Protects API from OWASP attacks and bots."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-gw","from":"app","to":"gw","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"say","text":"Function Compute handles requests and scales to zero when idle, so you pay nothing during quiet periods."}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"API Functions","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs REST handlers, scales instantly on spikes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-api","from":"gw","to":"api"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and hot data to reduce latency."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"tablestore","label":"Data Store","group":"sg","why":"Serverless NoSQL storage, pay per request."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db"}
{"t":"node","id":"files","product":"oss","label":"File Storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores uploaded files and static assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-files","from":"api","to":"files"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and metrics for debugging."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API with HTTPDNS, Cloud-native API Gateway, WAF, Function Compute, Tair, Tablestore and OSS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an ACK-based Kubernetes platform with a cloud-native API gateway, MSE for discovery, RocketMQ, Tair cache and PolarDB."}
{"t":"req","text":"20 Java microservices on Kubernetes"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ack","mse","rocketmq","tair","polardb","acr","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Clients","group":"internet","why":"External callers of the 20 microservices."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to the ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer distributing traffic across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Single API entry point routing to all 20 services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservice containers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack","label":"gRPC/HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service discovery and configuration for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","label":"discovery","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Async messaging between decoupled microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mq","from":"ack","to":"mq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Shared in-memory cache for hot data and sessions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database for persistent microservice data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"sg","why":"Stores container images for the 20 Java services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-acr-ack","from":"acr","to":"ack","label":"images","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and traces for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"ACK cluster behind an API gateway and ALB, with MSE Nacos, RocketMQ, Tair, PolarDB, ACR and SLS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available two-zone online store in Singapore with ESA, ALB, WAF, auto-scaling ECS, Tair and RDS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers","group":"internet","why":"30,000 daily users browsing the store."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the store domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches pages and accelerates dynamic content across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across two zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots during sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store application across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales out ECS instances during big sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and orders to RDS, both multi-zone for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores sessions and cart data with low latency."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Persists orders with a standby in the second zone."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images that ESA serves from the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes logs and alerts for operations."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Highly available two-zone store in Singapore behind ESA, ALB with WAF, auto-scaling ECS, Tair cache and RDS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll build an internal RAG assistant: employees query through an API gateway, AgentCore orchestrates Qwen via Model Studio, with Milvus for policy docs."}
{"t":"req","text":"Internal assistant only, no public internet exposure"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","cloud-native-api-gateway","agentcore","model-studio","milvus","oss","rds","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Internal VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"group","id":"ext","kind":"external","label":"Corporate Network","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"employees","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"ext","why":"Staff asking policy and wiki questions."}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Internal entry point routing employee queries to the agent."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-employees-gw","from":"employees","to":"gw","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"agent","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Orchestrates RAG agent over policy docs and wiki."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-agent","from":"gw","to":"agent","label":"requests"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Qwen models generating answers from retrieved context."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-llm","from":"agent","to":"llm","label":"LLM calls"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus Vector DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores embeddings of policy documents and wiki pages."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-vector","from":"agent","to":"vector","label":"search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Document Store","group":"sg","why":"Holds raw policy PDFs and wiki exports for ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-docs","from":"agent","to":"docs","label":"read docs"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Chat History DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Persists conversation history and agent state."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-db","from":"agent","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes agent traces and logs for debugging."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-logs","from":"agent","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Internal RAG assistant: employees reach AgentCore via API Gateway, which queries Milvus and Qwen on Model Studio, backed by OSS docs and RDS history."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll build a data platform with DTS for real-time MySQL sync, MaxCompute for batch analytics, and Quick BI dashboards."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","rds","dts","hologres","maxcompute","dataworks","quick-bi","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Data Platform VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"orders-db","product":"rds","label":"Orders MySQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Source transactional order database."}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS Sync","group":"sg","why":"Replicates MySQL changes in real time to the warehouse."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-orders-dts","from":"orders-db","to":"dts","label":"CDC","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"warehouse","product":"hologres","label":"Hologres Warehouse","group":"sg","why":"Real-time serving warehouse for dashboards and CDC ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-warehouse","from":"dts","to":"warehouse","label":"sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"batch","product":"maxcompute","label":"MaxCompute Batch","group":"sg","why":"Nightly heavy batch analytics over historical order data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-warehouse-batch","from":"warehouse","to":"batch","label":"nightly ETL","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"scheduler","product":"dataworks","label":"DataWorks Scheduler","group":"sg","why":"Orchestrates nightly batch jobs between Hologres and MaxCompute."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-scheduler-batch","from":"scheduler","to":"batch","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-scheduler-warehouse","from":"scheduler","to":"warehouse","kind":"control"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Business Users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"analysts","product":"users","label":"Business Analysts","group":"internet","why":"Users who view reports and dashboards."}
{"t":"node","id":"dashboards","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI Dashboards","group":"sg","why":"Interactive reports served from Hologres for business users."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-analysts-dashboards","from":"analysts","to":"dashboards","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dashboards-warehouse","from":"dashboards","to":"warehouse","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logging for pipeline monitoring and troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-logs","from":"dts","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-batch-logs","from":"batch","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time MySQL replication via DTS into Hologres, nightly batch in MaxCompute orchestrated by DataWorks, with Quick BI dashboards."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a real-time IoT telemetry pipeline: devices send data via IoT Platform, Flink detects anomalies, and DataV powers the dashboard."}
{"t":"req","text":"100,000 IoT devices sending telemetry every few seconds"}
{"t":"req","text":"Real-time anomaly alerts and live dashboard required"}
{"t":"plan","products":["iot-devices","iot-platform","kafka","flink","tablestore","sls","datav","sms","lindorm"]}
{"t":"group","id":"field","kind":"external","label":"Field devices","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"devices","product":"iot-devices","label":"IoT devices (100k)","group":"field","why":"Sensors reporting telemetry every few seconds."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"IoT VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"iot-hub","product":"iot-platform","label":"IoT Platform","group":"sg","why":"Ingests MQTT telemetry from 100k devices and routes it."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-devices-iot-hub","from":"devices","to":"iot-hub","label":"MQTT","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"kafka","product":"kafka","label":"Kafka","group":"vpc","why":"Buffers high-throughput telemetry for stream processing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-iot-hub-kafka","from":"iot-hub","to":"kafka","label":"stream","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"flink","product":"flink","label":"Flink","group":"vpc","why":"Runs real-time SQL to detect anomalies in telemetry."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-kafka-flink","from":"kafka","to":"flink","label":"consume","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"alerts","product":"sms","label":"SMS alerts","group":"sg","why":"Sends anomaly notifications to operators instantly."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-alerts","from":"flink","to":"alerts","label":"anomaly","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"tsdb","product":"lindorm","label":"Lindorm TSDB","group":"vpc","why":"Stores time-series telemetry for dashboard queries."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-tsdb","from":"flink","to":"tsdb","label":"write","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes device logs and alert audit trails."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-logs","from":"flink","to":"logs","label":"audit","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"dashboard","product":"datav","label":"DataV dashboard","group":"sg","why":"Live large-screen visualization of device metrics."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-tsdb-dashboard","from":"tsdb","to":"dashboard","label":"query","kind":"data"}
{"t":"done","summary":"IoT Platform ingests 100k device streams into Kafka; Flink detects anomalies triggering SMS alerts, while Lindorm feeds a live DataV dashboard."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a hybrid setup connecting your Singapore data center to Alibaba Cloud via Express Connect, with migration tooling."}
{"t":"req","text":"Private link from on-premises Singapore data center to Alibaba Cloud"}
{"t":"req","text":"Step-by-step VM migration to cloud"}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","cen","vpc","ecs","smc","dts","cloud-backup","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"Singapore On-Premises DC","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"On-prem data center","group":"onprem","why":"Your existing servers and databases in Singapore."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"express","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"sg","why":"Dedicated private line linking your DC to the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-express","from":"dc","to":"express","label":"private link"}
{"t":"node","id":"cen","product":"cen","label":"CEN","group":null,"why":"Global network hub routing between on-prem and cloud."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-express-cen","from":"express","to":"cen","label":"VBR"}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Cloud VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cen-vpc","from":"cen","to":"vpc","label":"TR"}
{"t":"say","text":"Now adding compute for migrated VMs and the migration services."}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Migrated VMs","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"ECS instances receiving workloads from on-prem step by step."}
{"t":"node","id":"smc","product":"smc","label":"Server Migration Center","group":"sg","why":"Lifts and shifts your on-prem VMs to ECS incrementally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-smc-app","from":"smc","to":"app","label":"migrate","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS","group":"sg","why":"Syncs databases from on-prem to cloud during cutover."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-dts","from":"dc","to":"dts","label":"CDC","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"backup","product":"cloud-backup","label":"Cloud Backup","group":"sg","why":"Protects migrated VMs and on-prem data during transition."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-backup","from":"app","to":"backup","label":"backup","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Central logs for migration progress and operations."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-prem Singapore DC connected via Express Connect and CEN to a VPC, with SMC and DTS for phased VM migration."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll build an e-sports streaming platform with live ingest, VOD, CDN delivery, and a backend for fan interactions."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","cdn","live","vod","mps","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","tair","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
